WHY THIS SHOULD BE FIXED
- `.Rhistory` contains developer-local command history and should not be versioned.
- `.Rproj.user/` is RStudio per-user IDE state and should not be versioned.
- Both add noise, can create accidental personal-data leakage, and make diffs less reproducible.
- Adding a standard R `.gitignore` prevents the files returning.

PR TITLE
`Remove local R/RStudio state from the repository`

PR BODY
`This removes tracked developer-local R/RStudio state and adds a small .gitignore so it is not recommitted. The change does not alter the mapping examples or data.`
